### 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Configure multi-tenant DNS
echo "127.0.0.1 tenant-a.test.local" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts
echo "127.0.0.1 tenant-b.test.local" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts
echo "127.0.0.1 tenant-c.test.local" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts

# 2. Install dependencies
cd tests/e2e/playwright
npm install
npx playwright install --with-deps

# 3. Start services
docker compose up -d

# 4. Seed test data
npm run seed:e2e

# 5. Start application
./mvnw quarkus:dev

# 6. Run tests
npm test
```

